# Direct runtime dependencies of the search API image (Dockerfile.search).
# Versions come from poetry.lock; regenerate the pinned file with
# docker/export-search-requirements.sh after changing either file.
#
# data_ingestor/__init__.py imports the document pipeline, so the PDF and file
# type libraries below are needed even though the search routes do not use them.
# Deliberately absent: torch, CUDA, marker-pdf, docling, gradio, playwright.
fastapi
uvicorn
httpx
pydantic
pydantic-settings
qdrant-client
pymupdf
pillow
python-magic
